            {"code": "ShowMessage_2", "string": "... and that's when we met you. So now"},
            {"code": "ShowMessage_2", "string": "you know the whole story."},
            {"code": "Wait", "parameters": [10]},
            {"code": "ShowMessage", "string": "DR. VAGO"},
            {"code": "ShowMessage_2", "string": "Frankly, it's amazing that you've made it"},
            {"code": "ShowMessage_2", "string": "this far, Talan. The Agency is not to be"},
            {"code": "ShowMessage_2", "string": "trifled with."},
            {"code": "ShowMessage", "string": "TALAN"},
            {"code": "ShowMessage_2", "string": "Tell me about it."},
            {"code": "ShowMessage", "string": "DR. VAGO"},
            {"code": "ShowMessage_2", "string": "I'm sorry that I can't be a tremendous"},
            {"code": "ShowMessage_2", "string": "help to you - I wish I could say I have all"},
            {"code": "ShowMessage_2", "string": "the answers for you... but I don't."},
            {"code": "ShowMessage", "string": "DR. VAGO"},
            {"code": "ShowMessage_2", "string": "But I think I can point you in the right"},
            {"code": "ShowMessage_2", "string": "direction."},
            {"code": "ShowMessage", "string": "TALAN"},
            {"code": "ShowMessage_2", "string": "What do you mean?"},
            {"code": "MoveEvent", "parameters": [7, 8, 0, 0, 2, 13]},
            {"code": "Wait", "parameters": [10]},
            {"code": "ShowMessage", "string": "DR. VAGO"},
            {"code": "ShowMessage_2", "string": "You said that before he was assassinated,"},
            {"code": "ShowMessage_2", "string": "the Director told you to \"seek Paradise...\""},
            {"code": "ShowMessage", "string": "TALAN"},
            {"code": "ShowMessage_2", "string": "That's right. I figured it was just an"},
            {"code": "ShowMessage_2", "string": "expression."},
            {"code": "MoveEvent", "parameters": [7, 8, 0, 0, 3, 3, 3, 23, 1, 1, 1, 23]},
            {"code": "Wait", "parameters": [15]},
            {"code": "ShowMessage", "string": "DR. VAGO"},
            {"code": "ShowMessage_2", "string": "I think it's more than that. You see, there"},
            {"code": "ShowMessage_2", "string": "is a village far away, nestled among the"},
            {"code": "ShowMessage_2", "string": "mountains to the west, called \"Paradise.\""},
            {"code": "MoveEvent", "parameters": [10001, 8, 0, 0, 14]},
            {"code": "ShowMessage", "string": "TALAN"},
            {"code": "ShowMessage_2", "string": "There is?"},
            {"code": "ShowMessage", "string": "DR. VAGO"},
            {"code": "ShowMessage_2", "string": "I lived there, for awhile - but, for various"},
            {"code": "ShowMessage_2", "string": "reasons, I had to leave. That was a long"},
            {"code": "ShowMessage_2", "string": "time ago, but I'm sure it's still there."},
            {"code": "ShowMessage", "string": "DR. VAGO"},
            {"code": "ShowMessage_2", "string": "Paradise is a small community dedicated"},
            {"code": "ShowMessage_2", "string": "to survival without the use of machines."},
            {"code": "ShowMessage_2", "string": "You can imagine that this doesn't sit too"},
            {"code": "ShowMessage", "string": "DR. VAGO"},
            {"code": "ShowMessage_2", "string": "well with the Agency; after all, the Agency"},
            {"code": "ShowMessage_2", "string": "represents the onward march of science"},
            {"code": "ShowMessage_2", "string": "and technology - to them, Paradise is a"},
            {"code": "ShowMessage", "string": "DR. VAGO"},
            {"code": "ShowMessage_2", "string": "nuisance, and they try to keep its existence"},
            {"code": "ShowMessage_2", "string": "quiet."},
            {"code": "ShowMessage", "string": "DR. VAGO"},
            {"code": "ShowMessage_2", "string": "The Agency doesn't like to publicize"},
            {"code": "ShowMessage_2", "string": "the fact that there's a thriving rural"},
            {"code": "ShowMessage_2", "string": "community that disavows its ideals."},
            {"code": "ShowMessage", "string": "DR. VAGO"},
            {"code": "ShowMessage_2", "string": "Paradise is an independent community -"},
            {"code": "ShowMessage_2", "string": "if you can get there, you could claim"},
            {"code": "ShowMessage_2", "string": "political asylum."},
            {"code": "ShowMessage", "string": "TALAN"},
            {"code": "ShowMessage_2", "string": "Are you sure? The Agency could just come"},
            {"code": "ShowMessage_2", "string": "in with their Guards and take me out!"},
            {"code": "Wait", "parameters": [10]},
            {"code": "ShowMessage", "string": "DR. VAGO"},
            {"code": "ShowMessage_2", "string": "I seem to remember an old law on the books"},
            {"code": "ShowMessage_2", "string": "saying that Paradise was to be a haven. If"},
            {"code": "ShowMessage_2", "string": "the Agency did that, they'd have a major"},
            {"code": "ShowMessage", "string": "DR. VAGO"},
            {"code": "ShowMessage_2", "string": "incident on their hands. I think you'd be"},
            {"code": "ShowMessage_2", "string": "safe. But first you'll need to get there."},
            {"code": "ShowMessage_2", "string": "Good luck, Talan. You're going to need it."},
            {"code": "ShowMessage", "string": "DR. VAGO"},
            {"code": "ShowMessage_2", "string": "Remember, Paradise is far away, among"},
            {"code": "ShowMessage_2", "string": "the southwestern mountains. Your journey"},
            {"code": "ShowMessage_2", "string": "is far from complete."},
            {"code": "MoveEvent", "parameters": [10001, 8, 0, 0, 2, 3]},
            {"code": "Wait", "parameters": [10]},
            {"code": "ShowMessage", "string": "TALAN"},
            {"code": "ShowMessage_2", "string": "Thank you for everything, Doctor."},
